# sentence_id = 98
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = And besides this, you seem to me to be betraying your own sons too, whom, though you could raise and educate them, you will go off and abandon, and as far as you're concerned, they will fare however they happen to fare.
# literal_translation = And in addition to these things, you seem to me also to be betraying your own sons, whom, it being possible for you also to raise and to educate, you will be gone, having abandoned [them]; and, as for your part, whatever they happen [to get], this they will do/fare.
